# Copy to .env.local for a local build against your own project. Both values
# are safe to publish (the publishable key only works through row level
# security); leave both unset to run the app in guest mode with no backend.
#
# Project URL: Supabase dashboard, Project Settings, Data API.
# Publishable key: Project Settings, API Keys (the sb_publishable_... value;
# the legacy anon JWT also works).

